<section aria-labelledby="mainstreet-approach-title">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="section-label">What we did</div>
    <h2 id="mainstreet-approach-title">We called organizations that buy research.</h2>
    <p class="cs2-intro">Our calls focused on the work Mainstreet could do for each prospect. A nonprofit might need to measure how common a problem is. An agency might need survey data for a client project.</p>
    <div class="cs2-truth">Ask what the buyer needs to find out and who will use the results. That gives the research team a place to start.</div>
  </div>
